{"id":"n60355-1-7","stage":5,"title":"불경 · (佛教)佛经","scene":"文化与信仰","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60355-1-7-1","ko":"불경의 가르침 중 기억에 남는 게 있어요?","zh":"在佛法的教义中，有哪一句让您印象最深吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"불경의","meaning":"(佛教)佛经，经","explanation":"불경：(佛教)佛经，经；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"불경","audio":"/audio/e8b0e2152b6a29ad0df7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60355","senseId":"1","lemma":"불경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불경의","audio":"/audio/d7e8ab3298d54973cc6e.mp3"}},{"text":"가르침","meaning":"教诲，教导，指教","explanation":"가르침：教诲，教导，指教。","readings":[{"term":"가르침","audio":"/audio/8900d861271afc64d6cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15295","senseId":"1","lemma":"가르침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가르침","audio":"/audio/8900d861271afc64d6cb.mp3"}},{"text":"중","meaning":"当中","explanation":"중：当中。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"1","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}},{"text":"기억에","meaning":"记着，记住","explanation":"기억：记着，记住；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"기억","audio":"/audio/603669bd762779d98169.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38812","senseId":"1","lemma":"기억","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기억에","audio":"/audio/f0f868283a1d8cc2b52e.mp3"}},{"text":"남는","meaning":"留，遗留","explanation":"남다：留，遗留；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"남다","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64552","senseId":"5","lemma":"남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남는","audio":"/audio/1cc88b8c79fe1e4642db.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":